DESCRIPTION:🌵Desert Roots: Chandler History Walk\n\nDiscover Chandler’
 s Foundations with a Comedic Twist\n\nStep off the beaten path and into the
  untamed past of downtown Chandler … where cattle once roamed\, citrus bl
 oomed\, and pioneers laid the groundwork for one of Arizona’s fastest-gro
 wing cities.  Desert Roots  isn’t your average history tour … it’s 
 a time-traveling stroll with a few extra punchlines\, brought to you by the
  actual comedians of Mic Drop Comedy.\n\nFor 65 fascinating (and surprising
 ly funny) minutes\, we’ll walk through the city’s historic core\, unpac
 king stories of early 1900s general stores\, silent film theaters\, electri
 c-firsts\, and Chandler’s original vision for a community-centered desert
  oasis. You’ll learn about the legendary “Five C’s of Arizona\,” to
 ur preserved architectural gems\, and uncover the lesser-known figures who 
 helped shape this resilient town.\n\nJoin us for captivating history\, loca
 l lore\, and humor that hits harder than an Arizona summer. Whether you’r
 e a local\, a curious traveler\, or someone who just appreciates a side of 
 sarcasm with their civic facts\, this tour is for you.\n\n📍  Starts & E
 nds:\nMic Drop Comedy Chandler\n51 E Boston St\, Chandler\, AZ 85225\n\n
